Package: hpn-ssh
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/rapier1/hpn-ssh
Description: HPN-SSH high performance OpenSSH client and server
 HPN-SSH is OpenSSH with high performance patches applied. It installs
 alongside OpenSSH: the programs are named hpnssh, hpnscp, hpnsshd and so
 on, and configuration lives in /etc/hpnssh. The server listens on port
 2222 by default.
